{"id":"w006t267i0i7ghuypt7vnt70i","title":"反卷积定理：打破百年 Fourier 思维","originalTitle":null,"summary":"一个多世纪以来，傅里叶反卷积将卷积变成频谱乘法，再尝试逐点相除，但存在单通道谱奇异和噪声放大的问题。反卷积定理提出，通过广义时频变换和统一的恒等重构条件，即使某些通道在特定频率上为零，整体重构仍可精确恢复信号。这一理论突破了将反卷积等同于单个频谱相除的狭窄理解，强调了跨通道合成的重要性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=634454&do=blog&id=1561519"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T01:23:19.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T06:33:42.776Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T06:33:42.776Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表"],"score":33,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"c9da2ec8-7a85-4a68-8cb2-0f79aa5d7468","title":"反卷积定理突破百年Fourier方法限制"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"c9da2ec8-7a85-4a68-8cb2-0f79aa5d7468","title":"反卷积定理突破百年Fourier方法限制"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fj3jB60iC3_M","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}